                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0ae47b37-d886-4f97-be74-bd96d5c1be3e",
                        "source_entry_id": "50b8e7c5-7a27-33b4-a964-a47cd42367ba",
                        "target_lang_word": "frighten away",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "86612630-680b-49b4-9a8f-753529366fd5",
                        "source_entry_id": "50b8e7c5-7a27-33b4-a964-a47cd42367ba",
                        "target_lang_word": "scare up",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "scare up",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5dd4bd1-6772-32e5-8833-f48974117852",
                                        "entry_id": "a7295bbf-eab8-3294-b539-2d9f75b1e6ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To frighten (an animal, especially a game animal) into appearing from cover."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "019e7df9-cdb8-4661-938f-d5d9b8650ac4",
                                                "sense_id": "c5dd4bd1-6772-32e5-8833-f48974117852",
                                                "text": "Soon after, we scare up a flock of black ducks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4eb60302-0df0-47e1-8510-8afc818cf25f",
                                                "sense_id": "c5dd4bd1-6772-32e5-8833-f48974117852",
                                                "text": "They ranged along abreast of the Snark on either side, pouncing upon the flying-fish her forefoot scared up."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82266e7f-86e6-4415-b810-9fab07112a4e",
                                                "sense_id": "c5dd4bd1-6772-32e5-8833-f48974117852",
                                                "text": "In September, Henry walked Emerson's frequent route, Hosmer's-Goose Pond-Walden, and viewed the pond from the hill on the north side with the sawed pine stump atop, scaring up black ducks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a94f0e1b-6811-3e5a-97cc-6a1732d67774",
                                        "entry_id": "a7295bbf-eab8-3294-b539-2d9f75b1e6ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To find or procure (something), especially something not easily found or procured, and especially while relying on chance to provide the means."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57de03ba-57d2-4544-a922-70f8bd34b7b2",
                                                "sense_id": "a94f0e1b-6811-3e5a-97cc-6a1732d67774",
                                                "text": "“By the way,” said his friend, “let’s go over into Leopoldstadt, and see if we can’t scare up a sleigh for a little turn in the suburbs.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80d1c3b9-19d3-4ceb-8ac3-3ee9c8ec9b25",
                                                "sense_id": "a94f0e1b-6811-3e5a-97cc-6a1732d67774",
                                                "text": "Scare me up some gargle, will you?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50604548-a0ca-47ff-aa1f-9fd765bad193",
                                                "sense_id": "a94f0e1b-6811-3e5a-97cc-6a1732d67774",
                                                "text": "Gil also scared up other part-time jobs while in high school—delivering gas canisters and playing solo piano at tea time at the elegant Hotel Stockton."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1747f65c-5b40-49e1-a1a6-c5084b8d9839",
                                                "sense_id": "a94f0e1b-6811-3e5a-97cc-6a1732d67774",
                                                "text": "Now, whenever he's in Nashville scaring up clients and I'm there scaring up stories, we hit the hillbilly circuit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86f2dfee-102e-42c0-806c-913eaeeecefc",
                                                "sense_id": "a94f0e1b-6811-3e5a-97cc-6a1732d67774",
                                                "text": "“With the current budget crunch and the Fingertip case inactive, I couldn’t scare up much enthusiasm.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2ed45e60-ef9f-495f-8562-d36d9be74463",
                        "source_entry_id": "50b8e7c5-7a27-33b4-a964-a47cd42367ba",
                        "target_lang_word": "aufschrecken",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aufschrecken",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e669195-4c12-33f7-b9b4-858ce8be02f5",
                                        "entry_id": "3bdea23c-cd24-3cc1-b06f-48823fd1ae2f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(eine Person, ein Tier) plötzlich erschrecken und damit aus dem Schlaf, aus einer Ruheposition reißen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d5df2fd-b718-4b4e-9020-77fc3d5327a4",
                                                "sense_id": "6e669195-4c12-33f7-b9b4-858ce8be02f5",
                                                "text": "„Der Geschäftsführer der Schutzgemeinschaft Ammersee Süd muss zusehen, wie sich immer mehr Freizeitsportler in das Schutzgebiet verirren und Zugvögel aufschrecken.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "969752a9-df35-3e12-ac8e-136eb9aea21e",
                                        "entry_id": "3bdea23c-cd24-3cc1-b06f-48823fd1ae2f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(jemandem) plötzlich etwas bewusst machen, was unangenehme Emotionen auslöst"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figurative",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3e8fc7b-1717-4c5a-a272-c4fe0750bf9b",
                                                "sense_id": "969752a9-df35-3e12-ac8e-136eb9aea21e",
                                                "text": "„Die Einnahmen aus nachversteuerten Einkünften addieren sich seit Frühjahr 2010, als die erste Steuer-CD viele Menschen mit Schwarzgeldkonten aufschreckte, auf 4,3 Milliarden Euro […].“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "aufschrecken",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7cf0941b-1ba3-3cf8-bac0-4df5397f9cac",
                                        "entry_id": "1c64d0a4-d042-3d6e-ac3d-0c336b89af37",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "plötzlich vor Schreck aufwachen, sich erheben, sich bewegen"
